# .dockerignore for the commit-image build.
# Goal: bake in the FULL repo (including .git history — the grader uses it),
# dropping only local build artifacts and editor/OS cruft. Dev image, not minimal.
#
# icu4x ships no root .dockerignore of its own, so nothing of upstream's test data
# or fixtures is at risk of being silently excluded here (docs/netnew-worker-prompt.md
# §4b — only relevant when upstream ships one).

# ── Build outputs / local cruft ──────────────────────────────────────────────
target/
**/target/
components/calendar/fuzz/target/
mayhem/kat/target/
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.dylib
**/__pycache__/

# ── Editor / OS noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
